Package: jmsbattery
Title: JMS Test Battery (psychTestR)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Anton", "Schreiber", email = "anton.schreiber@uni-hamburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: psychTestR test battery for the JMS study (DELTA-M): demographics
    (DEG), instrument and start of lessons, the Drum Machine Test (DMT),
    working memory (JAJ), matrix reasoning (MIQ), beat perception (CA-BAT)
    and melodic discrimination (MDT), followed by questionnaires (lesson
    time, CCM, Gold-MSI short version, TOM, TPI, MHE, SES) that can also
    be filled in later at home.
